<html>
<head>
<meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light">
<title>Thanks for reaching out</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#eef0f3;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#eef0f3;padding:16px 8px 40px;">
  <tr>
    <td align="center">
      <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width:600px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:12px;">
        <tr>
          <td style="height:4px;background:#2563eb;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding:32px 32px 8px;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">
            <p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#667085;">ryanbumstead.com</p>
            <h1 style="margin:0;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:700;color:#101828;">Thanks, {!Lead.FirstName}. Your message reached me.</h1>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding:16px 32px 0;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#101828;">
            <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Thanks for getting in touch through my portfolio. I read every message myself, and I'll reply within two business days.</p>
            <p style="margin:0 0 24px;">If it's urgent, LinkedIn is the fastest way to reach me.</p>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding:0 32px 8px;">
            <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
              <tr>
                <td style="border-radius:8px;background:#2563eb;">
                  <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ryanbumstead" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 20px;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;">Message me on LinkedIn</a>
                </td>
                <td style="width:12px;">&nbsp;</td>
                <td style="border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;">
                  <a href="https://ryanbumstead.com/resume" style="display:inline-block;padding:11px 20px;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#101828;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;">View the resume</a>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding:28px 32px 32px;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#101828;">
            <p style="margin:0;font-weight:700;">Ryan Bumstead</p>
            <p style="margin:0;color:#667085;">Salesforce Platform Architect</p>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding:16px 32px 24px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#667085;">
            You're getting this one email because you sent a message through <a href="https://ryanbumstead.com" style="color:#2563eb;">ryanbumstead.com</a>. There's no mailing list, and you won't hear from this address again unless I'm replying to you.
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
